    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/2eaa96a4e1b01b95bf5b15327167a4b2.avif?t=1749571495\" width=571 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a high-octane, old-school styled shoot \u2019em up (SHMUP) that pushes your reflexes and strategy to the breaking point. Designed in the spirit of 1980s arcade classics, it\u2019s not for the faint of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into five brutally challenging levels, arm yourself with 28 deadly weapons, and uncover a web of hidden secrets and bonus stages. Every run demands precision, pattern-reading and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1749571495\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1749571495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>Five Brutal Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through uniquely themed stages, each ramping up the difficulty and crowding the screen with relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1749571495\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1749571495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>28 Distinct Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rapid-fire blasters to devastating lasers\u2014mix and upgrade your loadout to suit any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1749571495\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1749571495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>Hidden Secrets &amp; Bonus Paths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny to unlock secret areas, challenge rooms and alternate endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1749571495\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1749571495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>Authentic 1980s Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect visuals, CRT filter and sprite-based explosions evoke the golden era of arcade shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1749571495\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1749571495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0<strong>Chiptune-Driven Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pounding, synth-heavy score that ramps up the tension and nostalgia with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.poster.avif?t=1749571495\" width=29 height=47 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/cd873b0a4720085e7c0ff104f132ccf2.webm?t=1749571495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Extreme Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master score attack modes and conquer the leaderboard for the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No checkpoints. No mercy. Just you, your ship and a hailstorm of bullets. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to test your mettle in ZAXTRON EXPLUS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/b3e71521c3d5b30494682dd6cf86b62b.avif?t=1749571495\" width=189 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/7e061b2cd22e15a653a7f454135fc4